00:07:33.770 --> 00:07:35.222
1 over 2 to the n.

00:07:41.030 --> 00:07:42.980
What was the attempt?

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:44.240
1 over 2 to then.

00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:45.710
Oh, 1 over 2 to the n.

00:07:45.710 --> 00:07:54.440
1 Note that would have
