about 1, and each of them

00:16:55.550 --> 00:17:00.740
individually has essentially
the same probability about 2

00:17:00.740 --> 00:17:01.580
to the minus nh.

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:11.650
So how many sequences are
there, must there be in this set

00:17:11.650 --> 00:17:13.660
that I'm asking about?

00:17:13.660 --> 00:17:16.480
They each have essentially
the same probability,

00:17:16.480 --> 00:17:20.800
the same small probability,
and collectively,

00:17:20.800 --> 00:17:23.890
the sum of all their
probabilities is about 1.

00:17:26.450 --> 00:17:28.160
Get to the power of nh.

00:17:28.160 --> 00:17:28.880
Right.

00:17:28.880 --> 00:17:36.740
Essentially, 1 over their
