it's a really small subset
of the typical sequences,

00:21:33.810 --> 00:21:52.200
the set of typical sequences of
size essentially 2 to the nh.

00:21:59.740 --> 00:22:03.970
So with all likelihood,
the sequence

00:22:03.970 --> 00:22:08.440
I'm going to be dealing with
is going to be in this set,

00:22:08.440 --> 00:22:14.950
in this typical set, which is
