00:56:47.870 --> 00:56:50.660
if chunk to encode
is typical, then

00:56:50.660 --> 00:56:54.410
you put a 0 followed by the
encoding of the-- encoding

00:56:54.410 --> 00:56:55.700
within the typical set.

00:56:55.700 --> 00:56:59.480
Otherwise you put a 1
followed by the encoding

00:56:59.480 --> 00:57:01.010
in the entire set.

00:57:01.010 --> 00:57:03.770
So take a look at home.

00:57:03.770 --> 00:57:08.440
It's a bit slow as you
