00:57:50.910 --> 00:57:54.210
So what we did was we
have here three coders.

00:57:54.210 --> 00:57:57.180
We have the Huffman code,
we have the Shannon code,

00:57:57.180 --> 00:58:00.630
and we have this typical set
code that we just learned about.

00:58:00.630 --> 00:58:04.410
There is a parameter here when
