01:02:09.540 --> 01:02:12.510
So it's used in a lot of
very common algorithms.

01:02:12.510 --> 01:02:14.850
Some of them which you
use almost every day

01:02:14.850 --> 01:02:16.890
like jpeg in
particular uses Huffman

01:02:16.890 --> 01:02:18.960
coding as its last stage.

01:02:18.960 --> 01:02:21.300
All of these do a lot of
things, but at the end

01:02:21.300 --> 01:02:24.990
of the day when you have some
stream you want to entropy code,

01:02:24.990 --> 01:02:28.650
you use Huffman
coding in these ones.

